  The scorer only measures — every label, column and line break lives here, and
  the numbers arrive pre-formatted in the scorecard's own `*_display` fields,
  because handlebars has no arithmetic helpers.  Nothing is re-stated in Python:
  a render is the model dump plus this file.

  Continuation lines open with their own newline, so a block that renders
  nothing leaves no blank line behind; the file ends without a newline so the
  render does not either.
--}}
